    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not that simple tho. they sacrificed everything for my education and my career, and i've just wasted it all. when i look at them, i see how much they expect from me, and it's just exhausting. i feel like i'm just dragging them down further every day. sometimes i think it would be easier for everyone if i just wasn't a part of this anymore so they wouldn't have to deal with my mess.",
